\"26\" r=\"7\"></circle></g></symbol><symbol id=\"art-leaf\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\"><g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M52 12C28 12 14 22 14 40c0 6 3 10 3 10s4-16 20-24c-10 8-16 16-18 26 20 2 33-16 33-40z\"></path></g></symbol><symbol id=\"art-heart\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\"><path d=\"M32 54S10 40 10 25a12 12 0 0 1 22-7 12 12 0 0 1 22 7c0 15-22 29-22 29z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></symbol></svg><header class=\"site-header\"><div class=\"container header-inner\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"index.html\" aria-label=\"Hearth and Crumb home\"><span class=\"brand-mark\"><svg class=\"art\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#art-wheat\"></use></svg></span><span class=\"brand-name\">Hearth &amp; Crumb<span class=\"brand-sub\">Bakery · Est. 2012</span></span></a><nav class=\"site-nav\" id=\"site-nav\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a href=\"index.html\" class=\"is-current\" aria-current=\"page\">Home</a><a href=\"menu.html\">Menu</a><a href=\"order.html\">Order</a><a href=\"about.html\">Our Story</a><a href=\"visit.html\">Visit Us</a><a href=\"visit.html#contact\">Contact</a></nav><div class=\"header-actions\"><a class=\"order-pill\" href=\"order.html\" aria-label=\"View your order\">Order <span class=\"order-count pop\">0</span></a><button class=\"menu-toggle\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Open menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"site-nav\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button></div></div></header><main><section class=\"hero\"><div class=\"container hero-grid\"><div class=\"hero-copy in-view\" data-reveal=\"true\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Small batch · Baked daily</span><h1>Bread, pastry &amp; a little bit of <em>magic.</em></h1><p class=\"lead\">We're a family-run neighbourhood bakery. Every morning we fill our ovens with slow-fermented loaves, buttery pastries and a few sweet surprises — all made by hand, from scratch.</p><div class=\"hero-actions\"><a class=\"btn btn--primary\" href=\"menu.html\">Explore the menu</a><a class=\"btn btn--outline\" href=\"order.html\">Order online</a><a class=\"btn btn--outline\" href=\"about.html\">Our story</a></div></div><div class=\"hero-visual in-view\" data-reveal=\"true\"><div class=\"hero-frame\"><svg class=\"art art--loaf\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#art-loaf\"></use></svg></div><div class=\"hero-badge\"><span><strong>Fresh</strong><br>every morning</span></div></div></div></section><section class=\"promise\"><div class=\"container promise-grid\"><div class=\"promise-item\" data-reveal=\"true\"><span class=\"promise-icon\"><svg class=\"art\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#art-wheat\"></use></svg></span><div><h4>Made from scratch</h4><p>No mixes, no shortcuts — just real ingredients.</p></div></div><div class=\"promise-item\" data-reveal=\"true\"><span class=\"promise-icon\"><svg class=\"art\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#art-heart\"></use></svg></span><div><h4>Baked with care</h4><p>Small batches, shaped and finished by hand.</p></div></div><div class=\"promise-item\" data-reveal=\"true\"><span class=\"promise-icon\"><svg class=\"art\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#art-leaf\"></use></svg></span><div><h4>Locally sourced</h4><p>Flour, fruit and dairy from farms we know.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-head\" data-reveal=\"true\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">From our ovens</span><h2>Today's favourites</h2><p class=\"lead\">A few things we're especially proud of. Our case changes with the seasons, but these familiar faces are here most days.</p></div><div class=\"card-grid\"><article class=\"card\" data-reveal=\"true\"><div class=\"card-art card-art--rust\"><span class=\"card-tag\">Bestseller</span><svg class=\"art\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#art-loaf\"></use></svg></div><div class=\"card-body\"><h3>Country Sourdough</h3><p>A 36-hour fermented loaf with a crackly crust and a soft, tangy crumb.</p><div class=\"card-foot\"><span class=\"price\">$8</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn--outline btn--small\">Add to order</button></div></div></article><article class=\"card\" data-reveal=\"true\"><div class=\"card-art card-art--honey\"><span class=\"card-tag\">Morning favourite</span><svg class=\"art\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#art-croissant\"></use></svg></div><div class=\"card-body\"><h3>Butter Croissant</h3><p>Flaky, golden layers made with cultured butter. Best warmed up.</p><div class=\"card-foot\"><span class=\"price\">$4.50</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn--outline btn--small\">Add to order</button></div></div></article><article class=\"card\" data-reveal=\"true\"><div class=\"card-art card-art--berry\"><span class=\"card-tag\">Seasonal</span><svg class=\"art\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#art-danish\"></use></svg></div><div class=\"card-body\"><h3>Berry Danish</h3><p>Soft, braided pastry with vanilla custard and whatever berries are in season.</p><div class=\"card-foot\"><span class=\"price\">$6</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn--outline btn--small\">Add to order</button></div></div></article></div></div></section><section class=\"section section--paper\"><div class=\"container split\"><div class=\"split-visual\" data-reveal=\"true\"><svg class=\"art art--wheat\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#art-wheat\"></use></svg><div class=\"split-note\"><strong>12 years</strong> of early mornings &amp; flour-dusted aprons</div></div><div class=\"split-copy\" data-reveal=\"true\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">A little about us</span><h2>Good bread takes time. So does a good neighbourhood.</h2><p class=\"lead\">What started as one oven in a tiny kitchen is now a busy little bakery on the corner — but not much has changed about how we work.</p><p>We still weigh every ingredient by hand, still talk to the farmers who grow our grain, and still believe that the best part of the day is watching someone take their first bite of something warm.</p><div class=\"stat-row\"><div class=\"stat\"><strong>12</strong><span>Years baking</span></div><div class=\"stat\"><strong>3</strong><span>Neighbourhood shops</span></div><div class=\"stat\"><strong>100%</strong><span>Handmade</span></div></div><div class=\"hero-actions\"><a class=\"btn btn--primary\" href=\"about.html\">Read our story</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section quote\"><div class=\"container quote-inner\" data-reveal=\"true\"><svg class=\"art\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#art-heart\"></use></svg><blockquote>\"It smells like a Saturday morning in here — and somehow the croissants are even better than the smell.\"</blockquote><cite>— A very happy regular</cite></div></section><section class=\"section section--tight\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-head center\" data-reveal=\"true\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Come say hello</span><h2>Your new morning ritual</h2><p class=\"lead\">Doors open at 7am, seven days a week. Come early for the good stuff — we sell out of the sourdough most afternoons.</p></div><div class=\"visit-grid\"><div class=\"info-panel\" data-reveal=\"true\"><h3>Find us</h3><div class=\"info-line\"><svg class=\"art\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#art-pin\"></use></svg><p><strong>18 Willow Lane</strong>Old town, between the library and the park</p></div><div class=\"info-line\"><svg class=\"art\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#art-coffee\"></use></svg><p><strong>Open daily · 7am – 5pm</strong>Fresh bread out of the oven around 8am</p></div><div class=\"hero-actions\"><a class=\"btn btn--primary\" href=\"visit.html\">Plan your visit</a></div></div><div class=\"map-panel\" data-reveal=\"true\"><svg class=\"art\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#art-pin\"></use></svg><span class=\"map-label\">18 Willow Lane · Old town</span></div></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"footer-grid\"><div class=\"footer-col\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"index.html\" aria-label=\"Hearth and Crumb home\"><span class=\"brand-mark\"><svg class=\"art\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#art-wheat\"></use></svg></span><span class=\"brand-name\">Hearth &amp; Crumb<span class=\"brand-sub\">Bakery · Est. 2012</span></span></a><p style=\"margin-top: 18px; max-width: 32ch;\">Small-batch bread, pastry and cakes, baked fresh every morning in the heart of the neighbourhood.</p></div><div class=\"footer-col\"><h4>Explore</h4><a href=\"index.html\">Home</a><a href=\"menu.html\">Menu</a><a href=\"order.html\">Order</a><a href=\"about.html\">Our Story</a><a href=\"visit.html\">Visit Us</a></div><div class=\"footer-col\"><h4>Visit</h4><p>18 Willow Lane<br>Old town</p><p>Open daily<br>7am – 5pm</p></div><div class=\"footer-col\"><h4>A little note from us</h4><p>Get word of the weekend bakes and the occasional free pastry.</p><form class=\"newsletter\"><input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Your email address\" aria-label=\"Email address\" required=\"\"><button class=\"btn btn--light btn--small\" type=\"submit\">Join</button><div class=\"form-message\">Thanks! You're on the list.</div></form></div></div><div class=\"footer-bottom\"><span>© 2026 Hearth &amp; Crumb Bakery. Made with flour and love.</span><span>Baked fresh, every single day.</span></div></div></footer></div>\n\n\n</body></html>",
